y-ArbsH93gdMS_E8EQmUvSElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3418341583","user":"龙**","time":"8月26日","star":5,"text":"这家肯德基在新开的新启汇广场，因为上海科技大学里面的肯德基经常新品一下子就售罄了，会来这边尝一下。比如上次新出的七虾堡就是来这里买的。七虾堡之前吃就觉得挺好吃的，中间的虾饼挺扎实也有挺多虾仁，这次调味换了新口味的香草柠檬风味，略带一些酸甜更清爽解腻，感觉也很好吃。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/rhZG_DHVqEcPb4tW5yRHnXP-hAq5ZOe9ULhifxwo0gZiFG6rNidJj6iVUQywGlccElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/JrgEsgMh6NlpcD4KnOhDanqfN_m-mPshyybZNybbb-oHm95M9Rn7Nt98mvhIA54OElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Ti8fqDGUE9LGLKGw9-ANhxmiNa80gYYd4ZmPzYiLL97qJuuM87DnC0uIVx2EpQU8Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Qv7vbGq-25jzq8YOGa3XmjXhib9dxOtvQ3PfPQyspmQnTayBAEfIa5V5KSi2VMw7Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3411079220","user":"匿**","time":"8月22日","star":4.5,"text":"比麦隐蔽，原来也有肯德基，板烧鸡腿堡想念了，很久吃一次还是美的。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3403549924","user":"聪**","time":"8月17日","star":4.5,"text":"肯德基整体体验很不错，店内环境干净明亮，座位收拾得很及时。香辣鸡腿堡肉质鲜嫩，炸鸡外皮酥脆多汁，葡式蛋挞奶香浓郁，香甜可口。出餐速度快，小程序点单方便，经常有优惠套餐，性价比不错。店员服务态度挺好，打包严实，不管是简餐还是解馋都很合适，日常就餐很推荐。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7jMUjXgbftPZdP7Ns8Naewrf8W0EdlJiHUCTprveHBSpSCT9e8D0-TZ2OCWv0MvOElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/czSY3SenoKzlwe2aC_her71p6_ZG1_d-SrSOdYpdXRbmw80REYeGyCBynvAdByOTElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/oboqSmdITwaw9-stOXeUUxLDxJ8MJESP0lVhOa0hTSnS8CWkZmdNZ7rahciGzYJgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3374454978","user":"匿**","time":"7月31日","star":4,"text":"下午找个地方坐坐，顺手点了肯德基冷静星期五套餐，9.9元拿了玉米雪糕，性价比可以。 雪糕做成整根玉米的样子，外形还挺像，玉米味比较明显，口感绵密，吃起来有点甜玉米的感觉，夏天来一根挺解暑的。 店里座位相对宽松，吹着空调休息一会儿刚好。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/8T2lzXntPaPaRYTat6nwseGkSlPGiYfkxECM8mc6Hwr5pDDfqCmlHXTuwAGlOCD0Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/CW9zqbeAQIqdeaipi7LFK5bPTCIYa0HduymcET5gLxhGri8JCC5aXBCn1m63GtuhElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BzqI9d7oDDGQAuRh19hExG18o0RcG2e_Q4iu2e6QMwel-G1OQLyMzJyutLRJVU4DElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3371140384","user":"酱**","time":"7月29日","star":4.5,"text":"山德士上校家也开始搞轻食，真的是暴力了，哈哈哈，还是吃鸡就行了","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3355661255","user":"匿**","time":"7月20日","star":3,"text":"真是我见过最慢吞吞的肯德基了，工作日中午12点一屋子的人在等餐，工作人员（1️⃣个人）不紧不慢的配餐，客人问某某号到了吗？完全没回复的，各位打工人脾气也太好了吧\n外卖小哥也是一堆人等餐，怎么问话都没人回复，纯纯无语","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/04f5a72b65badf89d118f0696f94b56d523049.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://p1.meituan.net/ugcpic/915408fc1e9cc2186c4748d080cf54bd568762.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3347238551","user":"B**","time":"7月15日","star":4.5,"text":"闪现张江中科路新启汇肯德基店，以肯悦咖啡而闻名， 餐厅比其他的店有高级感。 并且有车道的提货点。 服务也算是OK。 春卷的味道是特别，炸鸡也是蛮香的。 大众化的消费，年轻人的喜爱","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/AJ_aAZcWWbKQJEBo47EsNSuTBfwoZPJ_4FuPxeks2C5aGBlMnUFb8x1HXZHb38PXElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/1G2lZ1s-itgbJpFUWb9wne1IgrVucdClNmOhAsWnol-r8Y0PBhN6zWOUq92oiJ18Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/yLwmthZbBw8rqNu5ZysM6OC_FIJZ1pNiJBOdkhNtfUfSRa1ba_ERAJOCtqjUWvjLElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/bxFJrz-Gu98minXF7eECQcKbrJ3DtiIBIY-WH0CMKszVioFBOc86zK7McbJTQG8HElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3346477892","user":"匿**","time":"7月14日","star":1.5,"text":"吃了个堡 一会儿胃就不舒服了","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BIZsKnTw8ypMebjlwEoVcFSjcWFzNMrydOcmnjiuY6BRr15oiqXuigU5I1DHUh4bElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3338759115","user":"乖**","time":"7月9日","star":4.5,"text":"店不算大，估计大多数都是点单带去公司吃或者直接搞外卖。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3322916260","user":"可**","time":"6月30日","star":3.5,"text":"夏天店内比较热，出餐速度比较快。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3321981696","user":"f**","time":"6月29日","star":5,"text":"店里只有五个顾客的情况下，点了一杯浓浓抹茶生椰拿铁，十分钟都没有轮到我这单，直到上去催才开始做。喝了一口，感觉不对，然后去问那个店员，这里面有咖啡？店员说加了咖啡液，我就问他浓浓抹茶生椰拿铁没有咖啡，他竟然回答不知道！？。更可笑的是，他刚刚还在给旁边的店员做培训，质问一个小姑娘：“你没有经过培训吗？”呵呵呵呵，肯德基是所有新老店员都没培训，直接上岗的吗？","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3301306512","user":"小**","time":"6月16日","star":5,"text":"自从买了大神卡，无限回购，减脂餐每一款都好诱人，特别喜欢紫米饭，店员服务态度也非常好，给人感觉好亲切，赞赞赞👍🏻","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/lN78sh5O4YKH3KUzpEcc8ZBNcCuWHJy4xJfG-ut1c6ZG7IRfHv3usi9IqNBdPmRFElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3301016984","user":"匿**","time":"6月16日","star":4,"text":"没想到kfc出轻食啦！还不错，牛马打工人午饭有了。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3291727472","user":"一**","time":"6月10日","star":5,"text":"逛街饿了直接拐进肯德基，属于不管什么时候吃都不会踩雷的快餐，太适合懒人了。\n店里收拾得干干净净，空调温度刚好，座位也多，一人食、带小朋友或者跟朋友随便坐坐都合适。扫码点单很方便，不用排队等柜台，出餐速度挺快，拿到手还是热乎的。\n每次必点香辣鸡腿堡，外皮炸得酥脆，鸡肉厚实多汁，搭配生菜沙拉酱一点不腻。葡式蛋挞真的百吃不厌，挞皮层层酥软，蛋液奶香浓郁，甜度刚刚好。还有原味鸡，外皮裹满香料，撕开里面汁水超足，一点不干柴。\n薯条刚出锅最香，蘸番茄酱直接炫完一盒；土豆泥配黑椒酱汁巨下饭。疯狂星期四囤券性价比拉满，二十多块能买一大堆小吃。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3279677270","user":"Y**","time":"6月2日","star":4.5,"text":"味道很好味道可以，下次再吃","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/9Oq15GEhXhUwxwx_MzPHjqZhhV0YmGRI_7osDFN7WAOEYaOAyLXCvxA9SWs99TE3Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/c8fr-UpvBRxDI7eAjc5WG4xj5ngJ6ywXoCQu7wi5gbLaUbFyWWUB2ISuDe4O976rElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3279570907","user":"d**","time":"6月2日","star":5,"text":"不错不错不错不错味道好极了","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/48_H_GlZp2t9--VYOqCYCZVZxfVHIDwvMeN5Obe0Djn8x2OVur3RygXZ40jHihKdElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3272594541","user":"辻**","time":"5月29日","star":4.5,"text":"忽然发现很近开了家肯德基\n现在外卖平台竟然也不要运费\n新的粉蒸肉都出汉堡了\n据说里面还有土豆泥\n汉堡里加土豆泥的基本受不了\n还是点基本配置啊\n新出的酸梅汤还蛮好喝的\n下午饿的不行\n一个汉堡一个饮料基本就饱了\n充饥不错味道也是稳定水平","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3269759457","user":"匿**","time":"5月27日","star":1.5,"text":"这家肯德基8点结束营业，多次7点左右小程序成功下单但取餐时被告知缺货。小程序能下单，但员工不补货。\n总结就两个没有，这也没，那也没。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3261277478","user":"Z**","time":"5月22日","star":5,"text":"🥗很棒 \n很划算 新鲜","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/pXFq8BnXJqJAC4lbRbBL4kXl47z_QMUvrG_f59gKsBdeGn_FG3MJdk2dV45oNF0ZElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3260074116","user":"匿**","time":"5月21日","star":5,"text":"肯德基的汁汁双层嫩牛堡太绝了！肉饼厚实多汁，美式酱料咸香浓郁，搭配松软的面包，一口下去香到上头。出餐速度快，用餐环境干净，服务也贴心，每次吃都超满足，不愧是从小吃到大的品牌，必须五星好评！小食也很好吃就是没凑齐四位","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3256851594","user":"J**","time":"5月19日","star":5,"text":"口味很好，吃的也很健康","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/avM4QT4s419pcsBm05oj9cGwrdwK89972q_39Hw3BUQitTldIlduIW7Q-EMA3W4LElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3223682004","user":"匿**","time":"4月29日","star":4,"text":"口味：这家肯德基的薯条很好吃，汉堡也不错\n👫🏻排队：不怎么排队，但美中不足的是缺货有点严重，点了好几个品都没有\n环境：环境干净整洁，有可以洗手的地方，离地铁站也很近，肯悦咖啡、kpro轻食都连着开在一起。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/3asxvF6FW9PPcqyp0b4YD1luzZHxjg_9pB90pD6a5m4LX4X4Ge9OhqFMYyuYgN8PElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3208987152","user":"匿**","time":"4月20日","star":1,"text":"很差很差，搞活动在app上提前点了两个更香更辣堡，两对奥尔良烤翅两对香辣鸡翅，显示待取餐后到店被告知因为快要关门了不想再做烤翅了，更香更辣堡也没有了，要么接受换成普通辣堡和香辣翅要么取消订单。那为什么app上不写已售罄呢？为什么不打电话问我可不可以接受呢？八点就关门，关门前还什么都没有，太差了。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/elfLz6Y6k0bkKiCgurxOaqxlHikEB62YEXikj8tjz9RiFG6rNidJj6iVUQywGlccElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3208918791","user":"草**","time":"4月20日","star":5,"text":"千里迢迢线上点单，结果到店两个产品都说没有，也没有提前告知，直接擅自换成别的，毫无补偿措施。更离谱的是两辣翅两烤翅，只因不想烤烤翅，就换成4个辣翅，完全不考虑顾客需求。这种服务态度和库存管理，实在让人失望，不会再来了。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/19kXBHlmfRt835kqvry2jFcmafNk37-_68sVrRmOPVLPrCgmK_R3zLHnOWEB1I4wElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3181802881","user":"地**","time":"4月3日","star":3.5,"text":"👫🏻排队：晚高峰人挺多的 蛋挞原味鸡这种都有时候需要等一会下一批烤好了才能卖\n服务：会有人专门在旁边辅助点单的 微信大众点评核销券码都有人帮忙点 桌椅也打扫的很干净\n口味：因为点餐人多 吃到的大部分都是刚出炉的 味道很好","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3179076448","user":"小**","time":"4月1日","star":3,"text":"KFC作为老牌子了，但是这个菜品的口味真的不如以前好吃了，点的吮指原味鸡，以前最喜欢吃的经典，今天鸡肉齁咸，没法吃啊😦😦无语了。而且活动的汉堡🍔越做越小，真真的是品质缩水，再这样下去更没人吃了啊，太让人失望。活动幅度蛮大，希望菜品不要品质下降。严重缩水。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/qJY41h_GQr9CXYwpUTQ7kQusYg_w7a8xM5_Dni4GlTt-KD-nhepyxOE9SiVw2KmgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/NV575fLsUtZHFsvlo6t9frI0rJqEechoTOnwWHzNaX8xWgdxCmgJB8vbXWpkxUPMElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3178516960","user":"羊**","time":"3月31日","star":4.5,"text":"这次来肯德基简单吃了点，整体体验还不错。鸡块外皮酥脆，里面肉质比较嫩，口感稳定；蛋挞是热的，外壳酥松，内馅香甜顺滑，属于不会踩雷的经典款。店里的环境比想象中要好一些，空间干净整洁，坐着也挺舒服的。另外这家店还有搭配健身餐的区域，感觉还挺新鲜，下次想专门来试试。服务态度也不错，点单和出餐都比较顺畅。整体来说就是一家比较舒适、出品稳定的门店，日常吃个简餐很合适。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/D6sRzEPSrrnPKHk4qkjAc2K8gi4ViI8ZG3Ahfda8kRcV2FJAZejPRKWiF4hohxVEElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/qNS5jX7eaDfdQkGiG28Y3xejpub6P9vE1tfebgpXyI7v1wSoH_-B3AQbBJTOwoD1Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/AXx5zrRwNtDeB4OudVNc0oRfuJJvbuXAQbhUjrWtBMGGFAsHHLX_K0YH1kC2VZwkElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3169723719","user":"微**","time":"3月26日","star":4,"text":"还不错，有优惠买，挺划算的，好大","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3159829264","user":"任**","time":"3月19日","star":3.5,"text":"开在张江这边 实话实说 人流量太大了 服务不是很好 尤其是中午和晚上下班高峰期呀 店里占不到位置 而且也很慢 人挤人 快餐也不快了 要是想吃的话 记得错峰就行了 反正味道也没啥区别 偶尔吃一两次也就还行吧 不知道吃啥的时候也是一种选择 记得错峰就行了","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3158509784","user":"c**","time":"3月18日","star":4.5,"text":"翅桶太好吃了，量大吃个够，开心。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3150470457","user":"z**","time":"3月12日","star":4.5,"text":"肯德基旗下轻食，品质放心又美味🥗","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7ScmuT5EeUHE8fgpsDYLChVpxDpMznxAzG9Xxm2fXUrklvs-mRu_-lMBm_LTYsLgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/WRPPcxQaYqtlwH5dEyWJFF4JIbhfg6gBtXRVX8wuQzgKCEVPJlDbGkQ6y1